  m_text: 'How to play: Tilt with arrows, WASD or a swipe. Slide until a wall, player or ghost stops you. Yellow switches flip every purple switch wall. First to 5 gems wins. After every 5 of your moves a ghost replays those slides, blocks others and can collect gems for you. Undo (Z) steps back. Restart (R) starts a new match. H cycles the mode.'


'
